# 從頭再嚟
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:由開頭重新做一次；將之前做嘅嘢作廢，由最初嘅階段重新開始
eng:to start over; to start again from the very beginning
<eg>
yue:份文件我打錯咗好多嘢，不如#從頭再嚟 啦。
eng:I made a lot of mistakes in the document, so let's start over.
<eg>
yue:呢盤生意失敗咗，唔緊要，我哋可以從頭再嚟。
eng:This business failed, but it's okay, we can start again from the very beginning. [end of text]


